* useContext[+].code = http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/usage-context-type#focus
* useContext[=].valueCodeableConcept = http://SHIFT-Task-Force.github.io/SLS-ValueSets/CodeSystem/ShiftCustomActContextCodes#BHNCD
